<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3430/35  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5032/37  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6855/60  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2692/02  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     30.96/00   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.0830/35  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1512.5/4.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     111.70/75  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6022/97  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3334/71  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.7704/24  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.3998/05  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7947/52  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7315/25  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6716/21</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$378.40/378.90</p>
</text>
